  "solution": {
    "text": "The relative velocity of the bird with respect to the train is :<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mover><mi>V</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>BT</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>V</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mover><mi>V</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msub></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>BT</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />[because they are going in the opposite direction]<br /><br /><b><u><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0013_f4f2e7615ac2.jpg\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 100px;\" /></u></b><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;time taken by the bird to cross the train <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>5</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>15</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0&#160;</mn>&#160;&#160;<mtext>s</mtext> </mrow> </math>"
